  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** the 256 words are a basis (exact rank 256); the vacuum has a one-term expansion.\n\n## SoV expansions of BPS product states\n\nBPS state = v ⊗ w ⊗ v ⊗ w with v·w = 0 (A: v, F: w), equivalently ⟨0|ρ(g): v = gᵀe₁, w = g⁻¹e₄. For each family: number of nonzero SoV coefficients (of 256) and the values used in each slot (a₁, k₂, a₃, k₄).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "bps[v_, w_] := Flatten[Outer[Times, v, w, v, w]];\nbpsG[g_] := bps[Transpose[g] . UnitVector[4, 1], Inverse[g] . UnitVector[4, 4]];\nslotUse[sup_] := Table[Union[sup[[All, s]]], {s, 4}];\nrowOf[name_, b_] := With[{sup = support[b]}, {name, Length[sup], slotUse[sup]}];\nE4[i_, j_] := Normal[ee[i, j]];\nGT = Transpose[G];\nfamilies = Join[\n   {rowOf[\"vacuum\", vac]},\n   Table[SeedRandom[k]; With[{v = RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, 4] + 0, r = RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, 4]}, rowOf[\"random BPS \" <> ToString[k], bps[v, r - (v . r)/(v . v) v]]], {k, 2}],\n   Flatten[Table[If[i != j, {rowOf[\"exp(κ E\" <> ToString[i] <> ToString[j] <> \")\", bpsG[MatrixExp[37/100 E4[i, j]]]]}, {}], {i, 4}, {j, 4}], 2],\n   {rowOf[\"torus 1 − κ Gᵀ\", bpsG[IdentityMatrix[4] - 37/100 GT]], rowOf[\"torus Gᵀ\", bpsG[GT]], rowOf[\"torus (Gᵀ)²\", bpsG[GT . GT]], rowOf[\"torus 1 − κ G⁻ᵀ\", bpsG[IdentityMatrix[4] - 37/100 Inverse[GT]]]}];\nGrid[Prepend[families, {\"BPS family\", \"# nonzero SoV coefficients\", \"slot values used {a₁, k₂, a₃, k₄}\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
