       "data": "Out[839]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{E₃₄ coefficients c₀₀₀₀, c₀₁₀₀, c₀₀₀₁, c₀₁₀₁} & \\left\\{1.\\,,0.81222471,-0.27349289,-0.38052462\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{factorises: c₀₀₀₀c₀₁₀₁ − c₀₁₀₀c₀₀₀₁} & -0.15838694\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site} & \\text{direction e\\_j added} & \\text{\\# nonzero} & \\text{slot values used}\\\\\\hline1 & 2 & 4 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0,1\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline1 & 3 & 7 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline1 & 4 & 2 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0,3\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline2 & 1 & 8 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0,1,2,3\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1,2,3\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline2 & 2 & 3 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1,2\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline2 & 3 & 2 & \\left\\{\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0,1\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\},\\left\\{0\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3 & 2 & 5 & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\\\0 & 1\\\\0 & 1\\\\0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline3 & 3 & 10 & \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\\\0 & 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline3 & 4 & 12 & \\left\\{\\l… [latex truncated: 1649 chars total]",
