  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** the E₃₄ expansion is not a product (c₀₀₀₀c₀₁₀₁ − c₀₁₀₀c₀₀₀₁ = −0.158: F–F exchange term). Single-site rotations: site 1 + κe₄ and site 2 + κe₃ have 2 terms; site 2 + κe₂, site 4 + κe₃: 3; site 3 + κe₂: 5; others 4–17.\n\n### General sublattice rotations (BPS)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "SeedRandom[8];\ngenRows = {\n   {\"F only: v = e₁, w = e₄ + αe₃ + βe₂ (w ∈ e₁⊥)\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 3] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 2]]]]},\n   {\"F only: w = e₄ + αe₃\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 3]]]]},\n   {\"A only: w = e₄, v = e₁ + αe₂ + βe₃ (v ∈ e₄⊥)\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3], UnitVector[4, 4]]]]},\n   {\"A only: v = e₁ + αe₂\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4]]]]},\n   {\"SU(2)×SU(2): v ∈ span(e₁,e₂), w ∈ span(e₃,e₄)\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3]]]]},\n   {\"both sublattices: v = e₁ + αe₂, w = e₄ + βe₂ − … (v·w = 0)\", Length[support[bps[UnitVector[4, 1] + 2/7 UnitVector[4, 2], UnitVector[4, 4] - 3/5 UnitVector[4, 3] + 0 UnitVector[4, 2]]]]}};\nGrid[Prepend[genRows, {\"BPS state\", \"# nonzero SoV coefficients (of 256)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
